                "category": "Book",
                "attributes": {
                    "content": "SPACE STATION EXPLORER - STATION MAP\n\nNORTH SECTION:\n- Bridge (Command Center)\n- North Hallway\n\nEAST SECTION:\n- Medical Bay\n- East Hallway\n- Bar\n\nNORTHEAST SECTION:\n- Security\n- Engineering Bay\n\nCENTRAL:\n- Personal Quarters\n- Hallway Junction\n\nRemember to use navigation panels to move between sections.\n"
